        <mxCell id="card-data-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#22d3ee&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · data plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• A signed-in user calls &amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt;, whose backend needs &amp;lt;app-b&amp;gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; Browser sends GET https://&amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt;.staging.acme.example/api/v1/…. DNS wildcard points to the edge team FIP. the edge team nginx terminates TLS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; the edge team forwards plain HTTP to NodePort 30080 on any worker (static Endpoints, maintained by hand).&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; eg matches the HTTPRoute by Host, checks the GitLab id-token cookie against allowedGroups, proxies /api to &amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt;-backend.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; &amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt;-backend queries &amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt;-db.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; It calls http://&amp;lt;app-b&amp;gt;.staging.acme.example/api from APP_B_URL. hostAliases pins that name to eg-internal: no OIDC, /api only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; eg-internal proxies to &amp;lt;app-b&amp;gt;-backend. &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt; It queries &amp;lt;app-b&amp;gt;-db.&lt;br&gt;• Cilium drops everything else: frontend to backend, &amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt; to &amp;lt;app-b&amp;gt; pod to pod, &amp;lt;app-a&amp;gt; to &amp;lt;app-b&amp;gt;-db.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="630" y="1860" width="820" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-control-plane" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#a78bfa&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background · control plane&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; A developer pushes. GitLab CI builds and pushes vX.Y.Z-rc.N images to the registry.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; Image Updater polls the registry for new rc tags. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; It commits the tag to app-configs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; Argo CD pulls infra + generic-app-chart + app-configs and applies each app namespace. Platform baseline values load last and win.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt; Kubelets pull the images with a read-only pull secret synced from Vault.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt; VSO authenticates with its ServiceAccount, reads kvv2 and writes plain K8s Secrets into app namespaces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;G&lt;/span&gt; Dagster triggers Airbyte syncs. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;H&lt;/span&gt; Airbyte reads each app DB replica as bi_reader. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt; It loads bi-warehouse.&lt;br&gt;• Admins reach the API server and Talos API only through Boundary. No SSH, no public FIP.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1480" y="1860" width="900" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps between docs and code&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G1&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Storage and transport.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Docs: Cinder CSI + WAL backups to Ceph S3. Code: local-path only (node-pinned), CNPG backup off. TLS ends at the edge team. the edge team to NodePort and Vault run plain HTTP.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G2&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Isolation.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Docs: staging and prod physically separated. Code: same subnet 10.20.0.0/24, security groups only. NodePorts 30000-32767 open to 0.0.0.0/0: any host on the subnet reaches eg without the edge team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G3&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Missing services.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; RabbitMQ, the observability stack and the Clock are documented, not deployed. Chart rules for RabbitMQ egress and Prometheus ingress target absent namespaces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G4&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Secret scoping.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Every Vault role is bound to VSO&amp;#39;s ServiceAccount. Per-app scoping relies on the baseline pinning vaultRole (ADR-0001), not on Vault.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;G5&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;East-west auth.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; eg-internal has no SecurityPolicy: any app can call any app&amp;#39;s /api, the callee cannot identify the caller.&lt;br&gt;• Sizing: docs say m1.medium workers, Terraform provisions m1.large. Leftover empty namespaces: my-app, app-templates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2410" y="1860" width="950" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
